---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面走丢了">
  <section class="not-found container"><span class="eyebrow">404 / OFF THE BEAT</span><h1>这一拍，<br />落在了别处。</h1><p>这个地址没有找到内容。回到首页，或去文章列表继续看看。</p><div><a class="button" href="/">回到首页 ↗</a><a class="button outline" href="/blog/">浏览文章 ↗</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.not-found{padding:100px 0 130px;min-height:65vh}.not-found h1{font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,90px);line-height:1.3;font-weight:500;margin:30px 0}.not-found p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}.not-found>div{display:flex;gap:18px;margin-top:30px}@media(max-width:600px){.not-found{padding:60px 0 80px}.not-found h1{font-size:45px}.not-found>div{gap:12px}.not-found .button{font-size:12px;padding:10px 18px}}</style>
